  "id": "gentrification",
  "term": "gentrification",
  "definition": "Gentrification is an urban social and environmental process in which neighborhood change is linked with displacement, disrupted social networks, and worse health outcomes, especially for marginalized or vulnerable communities. In this source, it is described as a pattern associated with changes in factors such as home values, age, race, and education.",
